WEBVTT

00:01:48.766 --> 00:01:52.296
And now, the medal ceremony
led by Pope Vittoria.

00:01:59.033 --> 00:01:59.703
Yes.

00:01:59.866 --> 00:02:05.326
Nene is gone, but the Grankingdom's
troops are still out there.

00:02:10.733 --> 00:02:11.733
Won't be that easy.

00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:19.303
Good evening, General Logi.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.730
Since you're coming after me,

00:02:22.766 --> 00:02:25.996
then that means you must've been
Nene's pet all along, correct?

00:02:26.433 --> 00:02:31.603
You betrayed Lord Nene.
I cannot allow you to get away with it.

00:02:36.733 --> 00:02:39.303
We shall meet again.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.370
I bet you rested well.
Let's get going.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.730
Huh? Isn't the journey over?

00:02:45.966 --> 00:02:50.126
Who ever said that?
We still have some loose ends to tie up.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.030
What do we need to do?

00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:53.666
You'll find out when
we get there.

00:02:53.966 --> 00:02:55.766
Where to, maro?

00:02:56.733 --> 00:02:58.303
To the Sealed Grounds.

00:02:59.033 --> 00:03:04.003
ROSEKSTAN

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.100
I am General Horhel and

00:03:25.133 --> 00:03:28.673
I commanded the Third Squadron
in the Grankingdom Army.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:32.000
Due to certain circumstances,
the Grankingdom splintered apart.

00:03:32.033 --> 00:03:34.303
But there is no need
for concerns.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.670
I shall become your protector,

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:40.070
and shall eventually
unify the entire world!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.070
Hey!

00:03:42.333 --> 00:03:43.933
The general is in
the middle of a speech.

00:03:44.033 --> 00:03:45.033
Keep him quiet!

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:52.300
Now rise, people! Revere me!

00:04:02.966 --> 00:04:04.826
D-Don't tell me...

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.430
That's exactly right.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:08.600
Logi?!

00:04:09.066 --> 00:04:11.726
What's the meaning of this,
General Horhel?

00:04:11.866 --> 00:04:15.466
Uh, well,
with Lord Nene defeated,

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.000
someone had to bring order
to this world, so, I, uh...

00:04:19.266 --> 00:04:22.366
You have no right to
speak of world order.

00:04:38.333 --> 00:04:40.133
What're you
laughing about, maro?

00:04:40.166 --> 00:04:40.826
Huh?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.800
Oh, it's nothing...

00:04:44.166 --> 00:04:45.166
Maro?

00:04:47.433 --> 00:04:48.433
Maro?

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:57.930
What?

00:04:57.966 --> 00:05:00.466
You're happy to be on a quest
with Zola again, aren't you?

00:05:00.766 --> 00:05:02.896
Man, you're so obvious.

00:05:04.766 --> 00:05:07.926
Say, Zola.
What're the Sealed Grounds?

00:05:08.266 --> 00:05:09.866
What're we going there for?

00:05:10.433 --> 00:05:13.233
They're one of the ruins related
to the Soldiers of Light.

00:05:14.033 --> 00:05:16.133
And you'll find out what to do
once we get there.

00:05:16.633 --> 00:05:18.933
Oh, come on.
Don't be stingy.

00:05:19.133 --> 00:05:21.503
Hey, Zola.
Is it pretty there?

00:05:21.533 --> 00:05:23.473
Is there delicious
food there, maro?

00:05:32.533 --> 00:05:34.603
Are we going to be executed?

00:05:34.833 --> 00:05:36.173
N-No way.

00:05:38.766 --> 00:05:40.666
W-What in the world
will happen to me?

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:47.700
The world is in chaos right now,
and only power can restore order.

00:05:48.233 --> 00:05:51.733
That power...is the Shadow!

00:06:02.466 --> 00:06:04.696
So we are going
to be executed...

00:06:04.833 --> 00:06:06.903
We can't use Shadows.

00:06:11.866 --> 00:06:15.026
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan!
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan!

00:06:15.466 --> 00:06:18.496
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan!
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan!

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:20.470
- Rosekstan!
- Rosekstan!

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:25.500
I organized this Rosekstan to
restore order to the world!

00:06:30.666 --> 00:06:34.096
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan!
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan!

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.430
All you Grankingdom soldiers!

00:06:36.666 --> 00:06:40.966
If you will fight together with us,
I welcome you!

00:06:41.233 --> 00:06:43.033
What? We can also...

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.730
Use Shadows?

00:06:45.533 --> 00:06:49.403
And all you citizens!
I welcome you as well!

00:06:49.633 --> 00:06:51.133
Rosekstan?

00:06:52.133 --> 00:06:53.473
Rosekstan...

00:06:53.966 --> 00:06:55.366
Rosekstan!

00:06:56.266 --> 00:06:59.426
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan!
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan!

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.500
R-Rosekstan...

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.030
Rosekstan! Rosekstan!

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:10.600
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan! Rosekstan!
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan! Rosekstan!

00:07:15.233 --> 00:07:20.503
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan! Rosekstan!
- Rosekstan! Rosekstan! Rosekstan!

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:24.630
That was a great eloquence.

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.900
Don't mock me.
I prefer battle.

00:07:28.333 --> 00:07:30.033
There is a report
from Andropov.

00:07:30.533 --> 00:07:31.533
It seems Zola and the others

00:07:31.566 --> 00:07:33.426
have headed for the wilderness
in the southwest.

00:07:33.933 --> 00:07:38.473
So the information we received
from the informant was true, then?

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.170
Yes.

00:07:39.366 --> 00:07:42.566
And here I thought he was
stalling me with false information.

00:07:43.666 --> 00:07:46.266
The Sealed Grounds lie
ahead of where Zola is heading.

00:07:46.633 --> 00:07:48.803
It seems that's
their destination.

00:07:49.266 --> 00:07:51.196
The Sealed Grounds?

00:07:51.333 --> 00:07:54.473
Get a fast vessel.
We will meet up with Andropov.

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:04.300
They sure are carefree.

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.430
They don't even know
they're being followed.

00:08:06.933 --> 00:08:08.733
I'm going to go
get some water!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.300
She's alone now.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:14.630
Should I take her down?

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:18.000
Though, General Logi's orders
were just to follow them...

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:19.970
Wow!

00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:21.973
How beautiful...

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.070
Ow!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.070
That's right.

00:08:28.566 --> 00:08:31.596
It's more beautiful with you guys
blooming here, so...

00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:35.403
Hey! Kluke!

00:08:36.633 --> 00:08:38.073
We're leaving!

00:08:38.433 --> 00:08:39.873
I'm coming!

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.070
Bye!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.470
Answer...
Answer, Andropov!

00:08:49.633 --> 00:08:50.633
W-What?!

00:08:51.266 --> 00:08:53.166
Report your current
location and status...

00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:54.866
Is something wrong?

00:08:55.666 --> 00:08:56.666
It's nothing.

00:08:59.833 --> 00:09:02.173
We will catch up to Zola and
the others in ten minutes.

00:09:02.466 --> 00:09:07.696
I have something to discuss with Zola.
You hold off the others with Andropov.

00:09:08.333 --> 00:09:09.633
Can we take them down?

00:09:10.333 --> 00:09:12.573
Actually, I haven't decided yet.

00:09:12.933 --> 00:09:14.073
What do you mean?

00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:17.033
There are still secrets surrounding
the Shadow Wielders.

00:09:17.266 --> 00:09:20.126
I'm not sure if it's a good idea to
take them down before we learn of them.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.800
May I say something,
General Logi?

00:09:22.266 --> 00:09:22.926
What is it?

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:26.100
I have no intention of being
defeated by holding back.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.030
That's fine.

00:09:28.566 --> 00:09:30.626
I have no intention
of losing you guys...

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:31.770
Yes, sir!

00:09:37.133 --> 00:09:38.133
What's that sound?!

00:09:39.433 --> 00:09:40.433
That's?!

00:09:44.766 --> 00:09:46.226
It's Logi, maro!

00:09:46.266 --> 00:09:47.266
Logi!

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.600
W-W-W-What do we do, maro?!

00:09:53.666 --> 00:09:54.826
It's Logi, maro!

00:09:59.433 --> 00:10:00.433
Scatter!

00:10:06.466 --> 00:10:10.366
What do you intend to do now that
you have defeated Nene, Zola?

00:10:10.666 --> 00:10:15.566
That's what I should ask you, Logi.
What's that Rosekstan about?!

00:10:15.766 --> 00:10:19.926
We will bring order to the world
with the power of Shadows.

00:10:20.266 --> 00:10:22.866
I would certainly welcome
you Shadow Wielders

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:24.670
if you'd cooperate with us.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.670
That's not
a Shadow Wielder's job.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:29.970
Let some Knight Masters
take care of that.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.570
What're they doing here?!

00:10:36.466 --> 00:10:39.996
It's not like before, maro!
All we can do is run away, maro!

00:10:40.033 --> 00:10:41.333
I won't let you run away!

00:10:48.766 --> 00:10:52.396
Andropov, don't let them
get near General Logi!

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:53.870
I know.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.970
Wait up, Shu!

00:11:08.066 --> 00:11:09.066
Bouquet!

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.300
You okay?!

00:11:10.733 --> 00:11:11.733
Yeah...

00:11:12.733 --> 00:11:15.373
No, I'm not okay...

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.600
Hey...

00:11:17.266 --> 00:11:18.926
There's one more somewhere!

00:11:24.033 --> 00:11:27.973
This isn't the time to be getting cozy.
The real fun is just about to begin.

00:11:34.666 --> 00:11:35.666
Shu?

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:40.330
No fair!
Fighting from so far away, maro!

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.770
I'd like to get this to
a close-range battle somehow, but...

00:11:43.366 --> 00:11:47.696
It's about time we show you
our enhanced new powers.

00:11:50.333 --> 00:11:51.333
Wait!

00:12:06.333 --> 00:12:07.333
Damn it!

00:12:12.633 --> 00:12:16.573
You've always been so stubborn,
even as a child.

00:12:16.933 --> 00:12:20.233
If you're not going to join me,
then that's the end of it.

00:12:22.133 --> 00:12:25.233
However, I will not back off
so easily, Zola.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:27.200
Not until I learn
of your purpose!

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:30.930
What're you trying to do by
using those Shadow Wielder kids?!

00:12:32.666 --> 00:12:34.466
So you remain silent, huh?

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:36.570
Just like back then...

00:12:45.033 --> 00:12:45.703
Logi.

00:12:46.066 --> 00:12:46.726
Yes, sir?

00:12:47.266 --> 00:12:49.596
I leave this new soldier
with you.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.430
Now, come.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.730
Come, come!

00:12:59.066 --> 00:13:00.126
Zola?!

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:11.700
Zola?!

00:13:17.466 --> 00:13:18.866
Let me tell you
one thing...

00:13:19.266 --> 00:13:21.296
I have a personal
stake in this one.

00:13:21.733 --> 00:13:23.233
This isn't just some
ordinary recruit.

00:13:23.266 --> 00:13:27.126
So take great care
with her.

00:13:27.566 --> 00:13:29.126
Take care! Take care!

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:30.070
Yes, sir!

00:13:35.033 --> 00:13:37.503
My unit is under Lord Nene's
direct command.

00:13:37.766 --> 00:13:39.826
We're a mobile unit,
ready to rush into battle

00:13:39.866 --> 00:13:41.966
and destroy an enemy
under command.

00:13:42.466 --> 00:13:43.696
Understood.

00:13:44.866 --> 00:13:48.166
But let's set aside
military matters for a moment.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:48.870
Huh?

00:13:58.766 --> 00:14:01.526
You and your father
disappeared so suddenly.

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:03.600
I was worried.

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:05.530
We were on a journey.

00:14:06.166 --> 00:14:07.166
To where?

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.700
Searching for
true power.

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:11.270
True power?

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:14.770
True power...

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.800
What is "true power"?

00:14:17.666 --> 00:14:19.796
I think you'll figure it out
soon enough.

00:14:24.933 --> 00:14:25.933
Zola...

00:14:26.933 --> 00:14:27.933
Zola...

00:14:28.066 --> 00:14:31.796
You never opened up to me.
Not once.

00:14:32.133 --> 00:14:35.873
Even when we talked about
your hometown or your parents...

00:14:36.233 --> 00:14:37.233
Never.

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.500
Why, Zola?!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.470
Why?!

00:14:51.966 --> 00:14:55.366
Zola! Don't tell me
you forgot about this scar!

00:14:56.433 --> 00:14:59.833
Logi!
Crush the rebellion forces!

00:15:00.166 --> 00:15:01.826
Crush, crush!

00:15:02.033 --> 00:15:02.703
Yes, sir.

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:07.530
The local royalists have
risen up against Lord Nene.

00:15:07.733 --> 00:15:10.533
We are heading off to
crush the rebel forces!

00:15:17.166 --> 00:15:19.466
The aerial unit will
drop bombs to cover us.

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.800
Then we, the ground unit,
will storm in.

00:15:22.033 --> 00:15:23.033
Until then...

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.500
Hold it, Zola!
What're you doing?!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.200
We're supposed to get

00:15:28.233 --> 00:15:29.773
the rebel forces
under control, right?!

00:15:34.166 --> 00:15:36.296
Stop, Zola!
Do you want to die?!

00:15:41.566 --> 00:15:42.566
What's that?!

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:44.600
That's...

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:46.300
a Shadow!

00:15:50.133 --> 00:15:52.273
All troops!
Wait here for my orders!

00:15:57.933 --> 00:15:59.233
Ray Stinger!

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.470
Hornet Pierce!

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:25.470
This is the power
of the Shadow.

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:28.070
Zola!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.030
R-Run!

00:16:35.166 --> 00:16:37.226
That's enough, Zola!
The battle's over!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.670
You taught me
something that day.

00:16:59.066 --> 00:17:02.096
You taught me that power is
necessary to stand your ground.

00:17:02.766 --> 00:17:04.796
I can agree on that.

00:17:06.933 --> 00:17:08.303
It's useless to hide.

00:17:08.633 --> 00:17:10.503
Alright, let's all go at once.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:11.370
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:17:13.666 --> 00:17:17.226
Go, maro!

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.770
Yeah, this isn't
working, maro!

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:23.030
Minotaur!

00:17:29.333 --> 00:17:30.403
This is too easy.

00:17:31.033 --> 00:17:33.503
Their attacks are stronger
than before, maro!

00:17:33.766 --> 00:17:34.766
Here they come!

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:37.600
You little!

00:17:44.533 --> 00:17:45.533
Shu!

00:17:46.866 --> 00:17:47.866
Phoenix!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:57.700
Are you okay?

00:17:57.866 --> 00:17:59.566
Thanks for the help, Kluke.

00:18:01.733 --> 00:18:03.473
C-Come on!

00:18:08.133 --> 00:18:11.733
You joined and fought for
the Grankingdom Army

00:18:11.766 --> 00:18:13.596
because you wanted to be
acknowledged by Nene,

00:18:13.633 --> 00:18:16.303
so that you can get the information
he had about Shadows, right?

00:18:16.466 --> 00:18:18.626
And even now, you're
still searching for something.

00:18:19.166 --> 00:18:20.166
What're you searching for?!

00:18:20.966 --> 00:18:22.466
The truth of Shadows.

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:28.000
You want to join me, Logi?
You'll learn everything if you do.

00:18:28.266 --> 00:18:31.026
That's why you became
a Shadow Wielder too, right?

00:18:31.433 --> 00:18:32.903
The Sealed Grounds, huh?

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:36.230
What will you do once you find
this so-called "the truth of Shadows"?

00:18:36.533 --> 00:18:39.273
I'm telling you,
you'll learn everything if you join me.

00:18:39.366 --> 00:18:41.796
You won't tell me until
the bitter end, huh?

00:18:42.233 --> 00:18:45.773
I'd forgotten how stubborn you are.
It can't be helped.

00:18:48.333 --> 00:18:53.003
Schneider, Andropov. Anybody will do.
Capture one of the Shadow Wielders!

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.770
It is a very tempting offer, Zola.

00:18:56.966 --> 00:18:59.666
But there's a voice
inside me warning me

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.030
that it's dangerous
to act on your terms.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.530
This time,
I'll have you act on my terms.

00:19:05.866 --> 00:19:06.866
General Logi?!

00:19:07.333 --> 00:19:08.403
But who should we capture?!

00:19:08.833 --> 00:19:11.433
I'll leave that to you.
One is fine.

00:19:11.833 --> 00:19:13.403
What's the idea, Logi?!

00:19:13.433 --> 00:19:16.373
If you're not going to
tell me about it,

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:18.070
I'll just have to ask
one of your friends!

00:19:18.566 --> 00:19:19.566
Logi!

00:19:20.266 --> 00:19:23.666
I'll be in charge now.
It won't be like that time!

00:19:28.366 --> 00:19:30.226
Who is it going to be,
Andropov?

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:33.900
It's too dangerous
to attack head on!

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:36.800
It'll be okay! Leave it to me!

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.330
Blue Explosion!

00:19:48.066 --> 00:19:49.196
Alright!

00:19:49.233 --> 00:19:50.233
Yes!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.500
Kluke!

00:19:59.966 --> 00:20:01.096
Let's take this one.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:13.600
Kluke!

00:20:13.966 --> 00:20:16.266
No, it won't break!

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:18.230
Help me, Shu!

00:20:18.566 --> 00:20:19.926
Kluke!

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:40.430
I'll listen whenever you're ready
to talk about the truth, Zola.

00:20:41.333 --> 00:20:42.333
Logi!

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:45.870
Attack all at once!

00:20:46.033 --> 00:20:47.033
Right!

00:20:47.066 --> 00:20:48.196
Let's go.

00:20:48.233 --> 00:20:49.273
- Alright!
- Alright!

00:20:49.533 --> 00:20:51.973
Sorry, but we don't have
the time to deal with you.

00:21:00.566 --> 00:21:01.796
It won't budge!

00:21:02.433 --> 00:21:03.433
Kluke!

00:21:03.566 --> 00:21:04.566
Shu!

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:07.970
Let us out of here already!

00:21:13.533 --> 00:21:14.533
Kluke!

00:21:25.466 --> 00:21:26.466
Kluke!

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:27.570
Kluke!

00:21:29.266 --> 00:21:30.266
Kluke...

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:31.870
Wait, maro!

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:33.100
Go, Hippo!

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:34.670
Go, Blue Dragon!

00:21:42.933 --> 00:21:43.933
Kluke!

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:50.200
She might not look it, but she's still
a descendant of the Soldiers of Light...

00:21:51.933 --> 00:21:53.873
Let's make sure she
can't use her Shadow.

00:21:55.233 --> 00:21:56.233
Yeah.

00:21:59.433 --> 00:22:00.873
Good work.

00:22:01.966 --> 00:22:06.826
General Logi.
Please let us fight full on next time.

00:22:07.233 --> 00:22:08.533
I'll consider it.

00:22:09.066 --> 00:22:11.866
General Logi, we captured
a Shadow Wielder as ordered.

00:22:11.933 --> 00:22:12.933
What is the plan?

00:22:14.466 --> 00:22:19.166
I'll get her to tell us what she knows
about Shadows and Zola.

00:22:22.933 --> 00:22:23.603
Zola!

00:22:23.833 --> 00:22:24.833
Are you guys okay?!

00:22:25.100 --> 00:22:26.470
We've got trouble, maro!

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:29.800
Kluke was...
Kluke was taken by Logi's men!

00:22:30.266 --> 00:22:31.266
What?!

00:22:31.300 --> 00:22:32.300
Kluke was taken?!

00:22:32.466 --> 00:22:35.066
What're they after
by taking Kluke?

00:22:35.366 --> 00:22:37.896
Zola! We've got to
go save her!

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:41.970
Logi!

00:24:17.400 --> 00:24:20.670
Kluke has been taken away by Logi
and is being interrogated mercilessly.

00:24:20.766 --> 00:24:23.996
That jerk Logi is trying to
get our secrets from Kluke!

00:24:24.033 --> 00:24:26.733
He'll find out that I wet myself, maro.

00:24:26.766 --> 00:24:28.896
He'll find out my measurements.

00:24:28.933 --> 00:24:31.033
He'll also know that
I actually wear briefs.

00:24:31.066 --> 00:24:32.196
No, I don't know those facts...

00:24:32.466 --> 00:24:35.096
